Scope

The MIT licence above covers the studio software and its documentation:
tools/, templates/, brand/brand.css, brand/frame.md, brand/pronunciations.yaml,
docs/, the .github/ workflows, pyproject.toml, README.md, AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md.

It does NOT cover editorial content. Everything under episodes/ and scripts/
(scripts, narration audio, timings, scene designs, thumbnails and the videos
made from them) is Copyright (c) 2026 World Socialist Web Site, all rights
reserved.

Third-party files keep their own licences:
  - brand/fonts/: PT Serif, Source Sans 3 and JetBrains Mono, SIL Open Font
    License 1.1 (see the OFL-*.txt files alongside them).
  - brand/vendor/gsap.min.js: GSAP, GreenSock Standard License
    (https://gsap.com/standard-license), as stated in the file header.
  - episodes/*/assets/media/: photographs, maps and footage remain under the
    terms of their original sources, credited on screen where they are used.
